overview: "We're looking for a Senior Python Backend Developer to join the FastAPI core team, working on one of the fastest growing Python web frameworks (91,900+ stars on GitHub) used by companies like Microsoft, Uber, and Netflix. You'll help shape the future of modern Python web development."
overview_reason: "Repository shows FastAPI is a high-performance Python framework with significant adoption (91,953 stars, used by major companies) focused on modern Python features and API development."
