responsibilities[6,]{responsibility,reason}:
  Design and implement core FastAPI features and improvements while maintaining backward compatibility,Core development role requires framework feature implementation
  Review and optimize performance-critical code paths in the framework's routing and dependency injection systems,Framework performance optimization is crucial for large-scale adoption
  Contribute to API design decisions and framework architecture evolution,Senior role involves architectural decision-making
  Write comprehensive tests and documentation for new features,Quality assurance and documentation are essential for open source framework
  Review community pull requests and provide technical guidance to contributors,Open source project requires community management
  Help maintain and improve the OpenAPI/Swagger integration and documentation generation,API documentation is a key feature of FastAPI
